# High-risk distributables pending explicit redistribution review.
# These never enter the repository, and this rule has no exceptions.
#
# Publishing one is a separate, per-folder decision recorded in
# _PROJECT/build-release.ps1 ($script:PublishPdfFolders). Consequence to keep
# in mind: a file published that way lives only in the working tree, so a
# clean checkout cannot rebuild the site with it. Reference such a file by
# absolute URL, never by a relative link, or the static link check fails in CI.
#
# Currently approved: 27-07-2026 - lecture slide deck, published on the
# author's instruction 26.07.2026.
**/*.pdf
**/*.pptx
**/*.docx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.eps

# Original first-day AppSec lecture materials were expressly authorized by the
# site owner for this public educational archive. Keep them reproducible in
# the repository; generated ZIP bundles remain ignored above.
!appsec-lections/downloads/day-01/**/*.pdf
!appsec-lections/downloads/day-01/**/*.docx

# Third-party/course materials pending explicit redistribution review
**/materials_from_4days/
**/IMG_*.jpg
p19/materials/
astralinux01/materials/astra-linux-se-1.8.3.7/

# Teacher-only lecture materials: plans, methodology, answer keys and any
# third-party course documents. Never tracked - the repository is public and
# some source documents carry redistribution restrictions.
**/_teacher/

# Quarantine / old material parking
_НА_УДАЛЕНИЕ_*/

